- T3 Enforceability test: can it actually stop a commit/task/handoff today, by script or by a named judging step? If nothing can catch it, MUST is a command that cannot be obeyed and will be ignored — SHOULD instead. (my #16 orders clear then enforced; my #11 foreknowledge from what is real; my #1 count before commit)

